  "worked_solution": "In the model, we have $\\frac{3}{4}$ multiplied by $2.$ This means that we need to make $2$ copies of the given fraction model.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/7f38f5df7cb470af42c95a58a856ae4705725e24540ec65ba60a1b169e50c5ef.png)\n\n \n\nSo, the missing picture is:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/9dd3a347b27af1feef86000833c4a57042b7bc161f1ac5830aaa67c1d7322ccb.png)",
