-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> copies of the given fraction model.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-60157-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-60157-e-0\"></div> \n\n<p>So, the missing picture is:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-60157-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-60157-a-1\"></div> <div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-60157-a-4\"> </div></div>",
